    "iast": "arjuna uvācha\npaśhyāmi devāns tava deva dehe\nsarvāns tathā bhūta-viśheṣha-saṅghān\nbrahmāṇam īśhaṁ kamalāsana-stham\nṛiṣhīnśh cha sarvān uragānśh cha divyān",
